title: <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> withdaws from government in Württemberg
subtitle: This coalition could have never worked out
view-if: year == 1923 and month == 5 and wurttemberg_spd == 1
on-arrival: wurttemberg_gov = "Bourgeois"; wurttemberg_spd = 2; rural_spd -= 2; spd_z_wurttemberg_hate += 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true
face-image: img/land/Württemberg.jpg

[? if uspd_joined >= 2: After the death of the local Interior Minister our local branch claimed the office. The <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**Center Party**</span> denied this since they largely see us as a threat to federalism and confessional education. ?]

Despite holding the Labour-Agriculture Ministry we were not able to make any progress in fulfilling our programme's promises, we need to withdraw if we want to maintain our local base.

- @tolerate_wurttemberg: We will remain in toleration
- @fuck_you_bolz: We won't tolerate this government

@tolerate_wurttemberg
subtitle: This might reflect badly on us.
on-arrival: rural_kpd += 1

We keep tolerating the coalition we have just withrawn from in order to prevent them from pandering to the right.

@fuck_you_bolz
subtitle: This could provoke a further shift to the right.
on-arrival: wurttember_spd = 0; z_relation -= 3; spd_z_wurttemberg_hate += 3

We won't cooperate with the <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**Center Party**</span> in Württemberg.

  
